-
-## Workflow Refresh Integration
-
-### Automatic Spec Lifecycle
-```mermaid
-graph TD
-    A[/create-spec Command] --> B[Generate Initial Spec]
-    B --> C[Enable Workflow Refresh]
-    C --> D[Start Monitoring]
